plate_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le02ob11re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "id": 0}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn10le02ob11re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn10le02ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le02ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le02ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "text": "When people choose a movie or television show to watch, they tune in because they want to see their favorite actors or a thrilling story. What they don't realize is that wherever films are being produced, some of the most important people on the set are the stunt people.<br/>The earliest stunts were performed by circus acrobats. They were reported to have worked without the help of nets or safety harnesses. Audiences must have been alarmed to see these daredevils free falling with no protection whatsoever. Eventually, stunt performers were employed by live theater acts, and finally by early cinema.", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le02ob11re2img02.jpg", "time": "35500", "text": "As more and more big budget special effects were featured in productions, they began to rely more heavily on these dedicated professionals. But how do stunt people prepare for their distressing and unsettling job?<br/>There are a few schools for stunt people, mainly in California, but many \"learn the ropes\" by doing the actual job, the way a welder or an artist might. Many follow the same trajectory as noted stuntman Jim West. \u201cAt first, I may have been hired to do a few small stunts because of my athletic ability,\u201d he said. \u201cBut slowly, as I learned from other stunt people, I mastered a greater variety of stunts safely and convincingly.\u201d", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le02ob11re2img03.jpg", "time": "77600", "text": "Being a stunt person is an exhilarating and difficult profession, but it is rarely a gratifying one, given that the glorified lead actors seem to get all the credit. The stunt people must be satisfied with having participated in the production. Without these men and women who almost never become famous, the movies and TV shows we love just wouldn't be the same.", "id": 3}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}